# The decoders CUDA's producers read, per form that bounds them
# (`seismic_lang::producers`): the one statement of reach, from which the
# build renders `<seismic/producers.cuh>`. The folded and int8 GEMMs read
# every packed-rows weight's codes as exact operand integers
# (`packets::Packed::s8`, `packets::Records::s8`) and declare no bound; the
# int8 GEMM's local-scale form multiplies local codes it reads from the
# scales plane (`packets::Hier::staged_local`), as `Packed` asserts.

form INT8_LOCAL
locals=plane
